{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7490c76a5d7574491214076733a49956d8665dd383a9272690d0413822fdfa0f", "ja": "のり子、お疲れさま。新人興行ステージのこと、\nブログに書いたんだな。", "zh": "法子，辛苦了。\n你把新人演出时的事写进部落格了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "dc93bb9a49027b0bb047666f6dd3d242159dc25c8901d2e7b0ef1a18eb25cb9a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nど、どうだった……？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n你、你觉得怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1002_p", "source_sha256": "25e7aa0e224311dd1d488e7c992df2d3efa1222e87f270d6928037230dcc2175", "ja": "うん。熱い内容で、のり子らしかったよ。\n本当にお疲れ！", "zh": "嗯，内容很热血，很符合法子的风格呢。\n真的辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "2285718ff4fe649ad763fb21a29b8ad686b39e6fa5039b9cc07631823c26a28f", "ja": "ホント！？　よかった～。なるべく素直に\n書いてみたつもりだけど、やっぱ文章って難しいね！", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了～\n我试着尽量如实写出想法了，但写文章真的好难喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "ca636534114b1d0445aff915d158abcab4f69d551b36b87295de5bec83e0c641", "ja": "ステージを見に来られなかったみんなに、すこしでも\nリングの熱気が伝わってたらいいな～、なんて。", "zh": "我是想说，要是多少能把擂台上的热烈气氛\n传达给没能来看表演的人就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8781dddfd969d46d51ec0f97c07ada2ac1d4ece821a49a4968a948959b2a0808", "ja": "十分伝わったと思うよ。また次のステージがあったら、\n今度はもっと、大勢詰めかけるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "大家一定都充分感受到了，要是下次还有表演，\n一定会有更多观众争相来看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "9ed24740ae26a99022fd42fb6ebd5e0b062f13518164042dce7d2217a0d6731d", "ja": "えへへ、だといいな～。じゃあそれまでに、\nもっとパフォーマンスの腕を磨いておかなくちゃね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，希望如此～\n那么在那之前，我得先更加磨练我的表演技术才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "0eadf6f4ea2c0e5ae376092a3d99868376b4d29066bcbfd244fd1d53820a46c1", "ja": "えっと、{$P$}。\nセンターやらせてくれて、ホントにありがとう！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n真的很谢谢你让我当Center！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1008_p", "source_sha256": "beb502df146a95613436e7ceac30b090561ec16e8496c97b3a4b7eb723eb0ab8", "ja": "こっちこそ、ありがとう。初センターが\nアウェイの会場になっちゃって、悪かったな。", "zh": "我才要跟你说谢谢。\n真抱歉要你首次当Center就在不熟悉的会场表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "1ce123fef87a52861c8d5940c5dad575600969bf6f16db41ea6395c5c25503d3", "ja": "あははっ！　そんなの、気にしないでよ。\nホントに、すっごく楽しかったんだから！", "zh": "哈哈！这你不用在意啦，\n因为我真的表演得很开心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "eb15f4d4de8108a90de9c7e826c12f20b6cb37f90a7e8eb1b4d6337593131b2a", "ja": "それに、アタシのほうこそ\n迷惑かけちゃった気がするし……。", "zh": "而且，\n我觉得我才是给你添了麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2225411610c96615d399060105884de1928d6430f1a4dcb4be091b1631b002b4", "ja": "迷惑？", "zh": "添麻烦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_037_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "d6a4bb279f818e64394a81e655b7cb7870e98c37fce894c6dc36121d5a9fa553", "ja": "だ、だって、ほら……な、泣いちゃったりとか……。\nうわ～っ！？　思い出したら、恥ずかしくなってきた！", "zh": "因、因为，那个啊……我、我不是哭了吗……\n哇～！？现在一回想起来就觉得好羞耻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
